  "descriptionHtml": "<p><span>\u00a0Make Your Mark with Unique Designs -Perfect for personalizing school supplies, office gear, and home decor. Ideal for creatives, entrepreneurs, and anyone wanting to express their individuality. A thoughtful gift for friends, family, or colleagues. These die-cut stickers can be tailored to any shape, adding flair and personality to your everyday items or marketing materials.</span></p>\n<p data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"777\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"777\">Key Features</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"1253\">\u2702\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"806\">Custom Die Cut Shape</strong> \u2013 Cut precisely to the outline of your design<br data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"855\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"881\">Full-Color Printing</strong> \u2013 Sharp, vibrant, high-resolution graphics<br data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"927\">\ud83e\uddf2 <strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"956\">Premium Vinyl Material</strong> \u2013 Durable and professional finish<br data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"993\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1015\">Water-Resistant</strong> \u2013 Suitable for indoor and outdoor use<br data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1056\">\u2600\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1082\">Fade-Resistant Inks</strong> \u2013 Long-lasting color performance<br data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1118\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1138\">No Die Charge</strong> \u2013 No extra fees for custom shapes<br data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1175\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1195\">Versatile Use</strong> \u2013 Ideal for branding, packaging, promotions, and events</p>",
  "descriptionText": "Make Your Mark with Unique Designs -Perfect for personalizing school supplies, office gear, and home decor. Ideal for creatives, entrepreneurs, and anyone wanting to express their individuality. A thoughtful gift for friends, family, or colleagues. These die-cut stickers can be tailored to any shape, adding flair and personality to your everyday items or marketing materials.\n\ud83d\udd39 Key Features\n\u2702\ufe0f Custom Die Cut Shape \u2013 Cut precisely to the outline of your design\n\ud83c\udfa8 Full-Color Printing \u2013 Sharp, vibrant, high-resolution graphics\n\ud83e\uddf2 Premium Vinyl Material \u2013 Durable and professional finish\n\ud83d\udca7 Water-Resistant \u2013 Suitable for indoor and outdoor use\n\u2600\ufe0f Fade-Resistant Inks \u2013 Long-lasting color performance\n\ud83d\udcb0 No Die Charge \u2013 No extra fees for custom shapes\n\ud83d\udce6 Versatile Use \u2013 Ideal for branding, packaging, promotions, and events",
